Run these four commands:

ssh -Q HostKeyAlgorithms | grep -E 'ssh-rsa|rsa-sha2'
ssh -G 192.168.136.133 | grep -i hostkeyalgorithms
sudo sshd -T | grep -i hostkeyalgorithms
sudo sshd -T | grep -i '^hostkey'

The first two are client-side.

The last two are server-side effective configuration.

ssh -v -oHostKeyAlgorithms=-ssh-rsa admin@192.168.136.134 2>&1 | grep -i "host key algorithm"
